## Authority preserved

- `Observed != Validated` remains unchanged.
- Stable GameId remains source-native; the UI copies but does not derive it.
- Exact candidate values remain evidence/provenance correlation only.
- WPF does not load History for universal provenance or rebuild candidate spaces.
- WPF does not infer original Auto Tuner mode, validation, winner role or persistence authority.
- `AppServices.ResolveCurrentUniversalValidatedProfileProvenanceAsync(...)` remains the only application entry point used by this presentation.
- Existing five specialized winner roles, Profile Challenge behavior, Global Controlled Benchmark Lease, rollback/History and typed PresentMon authority remain unchanged.

